<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">
    <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        <ResourceDictionary Source="/Views/StartsideStyles.xaml" />
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

    <!--
        Settings page design contract (mirrors how the real pages are built).

        Typography scale (all settings pages follow this):
          - Hero title         FontSize 20 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground      -> page title at the top
          - Card/block title   FontSize 16 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground      -> main section inside a card (e.g. "System and startup", "FPS setup")
          - Section title      FontSize 14 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground      -> sub-section inside a card (e.g. "Overlay scale", "Restore after exit")
          - Body / intro       FontSize 13 | Normal   | SettingsSubtextForeground | Wrap -> descriptions under titles
          - Badge / status     FontSize 12 | per use  | SettingsSubtextForeground -> small labels, badges, console text
        Text brushes:
          - Titles always use TopBarForeground
          - Supporting text always uses SettingsSubtextForeground
          - Emphasis (buttons, links, selected swatches) uses AccentBrush
        Cards:
          - Always wrap content in StartsideSectionCardStyle (CornerRadius 6, default Padding 28,
            Margin 0,0,0,5 between cards)
          - Compact list/filter cards may override Padding to 16 (e.g. GameResolution category filter)
          - Hero sub-borders use Padding 12 (e.g. GamingOverlay scale block)
        Layout:
          - Wrap the page in TemplatePage and place primary actions inside Startside cards
          - Hero elements are separated with Margin 0,16,0,0 (intro after title uses 0,8,0,0)
        Alignment (SharedSizeGroup — REQUIRED for lists/rows with control columns):
          - Wrap the page content in <Grid Grid.IsSharedSizeScope="True"> once at the root.
          - Every list/row/category grid that contains a control column (ComboBox, Slider,
            ToggleButton, value TextBlock) must use SharedSizeGroup on that column so all
            columns across the page share the SAME width -> perfect vertical alignment.
          - Action/remove buttons belong in their OWN shared column (e.g. SharedSizeGroup="...RemoveColumn"),
            never inside the control column, otherwise the control shifts left.
          - Use MinWidth (e.g. 160) + HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" on controls inside a shared
            column instead of a fixed Width so they stretch with the shared column.
          - Use TemplateComboBoxStyle (StartsideStyles.xaml) for all ComboBoxes; do not copy
            the style per page. GameResolutionPage is the reference implementation.
        Collapsible sections (Expander cards):
          - When a card is collapsible, the header must use the Card/block title level (16/SemiBold/TopBarForeground)
            regardless of whether it is a hero card or a regular card. All collapsible headers on a page must be
            the same font size so the folded/unfolded state reads consistently.
          - Header content = title + intro (13), trailing chevron (&#xE70D;, Segoe Fluent Icons, FontSize 18) rotated 180 deg
            via BooleanToAngleConverter when expanded.
          - Inner content keeps the normal scale: section titles 14, body 13, small labels 12.
        When you create a new page, use TemplatePage + StartsideSectionCardStyle and derive text from
        the styles below so the whole app stays consistent.
    -->

    <!-- Hero title: page name at the top of the page. FontSize 20 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground -->
    <Style x:Key="TemplateHeroTitleStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="20" />
        <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{Binding TopBarForeground}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Card/block title: main section inside a card. FontSize 16 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground -->
    <Style x:Key="TemplateCardTitleStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="16" />
        <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{Binding TopBarForeground}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Section title: sub-section inside a card. FontSize 14 | SemiBold | TopBarForeground -->
    <Style x:Key="TemplateSectionTitleStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14" />
        <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{Binding TopBarForeground}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Body/intro text: description under a title. FontSize 13 | Normal | SettingsSubtextForeground | Wrap -->
    <Style x:Key="TemplateHeroBodyStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{Binding SettingsSubtextForeground}" />
        <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Badge/status text: small labels, badges, console. FontSize 12 | SettingsSubtextForeground -->
    <Style x:Key="TemplateSmallTextStyle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{Binding SettingsSubtextForeground}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="TemplateActionButtonStyle" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource LayoutActionButtonStyle}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{Binding AccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{Binding AccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14" />
    </Style>

    <sys:String x:Key="TemplateGuidance">
        Settings page contract: hero title (20/SemiBold/TopBarForeground, or 16 when the hero is a collapsible Expander) -> intro (13/SettingsSubtextForeground/Wrap) -> cards (StartsideSectionCardStyle, 5px gap). Card titles 16, section titles 14, body 13, small labels 12. Collapsible section headers must ALL use 16 so folded/unfolded stays consistent; inner content keeps 14/13/12. Titles use TopBarForeground, body uses SettingsSubtextForeground, emphasis uses AccentBrush. Wrap the page in TemplatePage. Alignment: Grid.IsSharedSizeScope at root + SharedSizeGroup on control columns; action buttons in their own shared column; MinWidth+Stretch instead of fixed Width; use TemplateComboBoxStyle (reference: GameResolutionPage).
    </sys:String>
</ResourceDictionary>